WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.897
At home Carabas locked his door.

2
00:00:15.898 --> 00:00:19.560
He fed Puss bits of bread.

3
00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.515
"Ah, Puss," he said.

4
00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:30.232
"I wish I had more food for you."

5
00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:34.941
Carabas ate his own dinner.

6
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:38.841
It was a small bowl of soup.

7
00:00:38.842 --> 00:00:47.005
He dipped some bread in it.

8
00:00:47.006 --> 00:00:51.218
Soon Puss went to sleep.

9
00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:57.817
A chilly wind blew under the door.

10
00:00:57.818 --> 00:01:03.406
Carabas put a blanket over the cat.

11
00:01:03.407 --> 00:01:14.328
Later Carabas counted his money.

12
00:01:14.329 --> 00:01:18.938
That night he tossed and turned in bed.

13
00:01:18.939 --> 00:01:22.771
"Soon I will need more money," he thought.

14
00:01:22.772 --> 00:01:29.503
"What will I do?"

15
00:01:29.504 --> 00:01:33.789
The next morning Carabas worked in the garden.

16
00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:42.976
Puss was sleeping nearby.

17
00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:46.053
A mouse ran past.

18
00:01:46.054 --> 00:01:49.768
Suddenly the cat's paw shot out.

19
00:01:49.769 --> 00:01:51.652
He caught the mouse!

20
00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:54.644
Puss licked his lips.

21
00:01:54.645 --> 00:01:57.453
Carabas blinked in surprise.

22
00:01:57.454 --> 00:02:00.695
"Puss wasn't asleep," he thought.

23
00:02:00.696 --> 00:02:03.325
"Puss tricked that mouse.

24
00:02:03.326 --> 00:02:08.004
He's a clever cat!"

25
00:02:08.005 --> 00:02:12.626
That afternoon Carabas spotted Puss again.

26
00:02:12.627 --> 00:02:16.673
"What is that cat doing now?" he thought.

27
00:02:16.674 --> 00:02:19.546
The cat was at the garden shed.

28
00:02:19.547 --> 00:02:24.950
With his back feet, he hung from the doorway.

29
00:02:24.951 --> 00:02:29.831
Just then a mouse ran by.

30
00:02:29.832 --> 00:02:34.368
Smack! Puss grabbed it.

31
00:02:34.369 --> 00:02:38.416
Carabas laughed softly.

32
00:02:38.417 --> 00:02:41.972
"That cat is amazing!" he said.

33
00:02:41.973 --> 00:02:44.346
He shook his head.

34
00:02:44.347 --> 00:02:55.362
"I wish Puss could catch food for me too!"

